# Environment Variables

## Frontend (.env.development and .env.production)
VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:5000  # Local development
VITE_API_URL=/api                   # Production/Vercel

## Backend / Vercel API (.env or Vercel dashboard)
NODE_ENV=production
JWT_SECRET=your-super-secret-key-change-this
CORS_ORIGIN=https://yourdomain.com,https://www.yourdomain.com
PORT=5000
DATABASE_PATH=/tmp/cars.db          # For Vercel (ephemeral)
